sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS
    participant Proxy as kube-auth-proxy<br/>4180/TCP
    participant OIDC as OAuth2/OIDC Provider<br/>(OpenShift OAuth)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>(Session Store)
    participant Upstream as Upstream Service

    Note over Client, Upstream: Flow 1: Health Check (No Auth)
    Client->>Route: GET /ping
    Route->>Proxy: GET /ping (4180/TCP)
    Proxy-->>Route: 200 OK
    Route-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client, Upstream: Flow 2: OAuth2/OIDC Browser Authentication
    Client->>Route: GET /protected-resource
    Route->>Proxy: GET /protected-resource (4180/TCP)
    Proxy->>Proxy: No valid session found
    Proxy-->>Route: 302 Redirect to {prefix}/start
    Route-->>Client: 302 Redirect
    Client->>Route: GET {prefix}/start
    Route->>Proxy: GET {prefix}/start
    Proxy-->>Client: 302 Redirect to OIDC Provider
    Client->>OIDC: Authorization Request
    OIDC-->>Client: 302 Redirect with auth code
    Client->>Route: GET {prefix}/callback?code=...
    Route->>Proxy: GET {prefix}/callback?code=...
    Proxy->>OIDC: Exchange code for tokens
    OIDC-->>Proxy: ID Token + Access Token
    Proxy->>Redis: Store session (optional)
    Proxy-->>Route: 302 Redirect + Set-Cookie (_oauth2_proxy)
    Route-->>Client: 302 Redirect + Session Cookie

    Note over Client, Upstream: Flow 3: Authenticated Request Forwarding
    Client->>Route: GET /protected-resource<br/>Cookie: _oauth2_proxy=...
    Route->>Proxy: Forward (4180/TCP)
    Proxy->>Redis: Load session (if Redis configured)
    Redis-->>Proxy: Session data
    Proxy->>Proxy: Validate session
    Proxy->>Upstream: Forward with headers<br/>X-Forwarded-User, X-Forwarded-Email
    Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client, Upstream: Flow 4: Kubernetes ServiceAccount Token Auth
    Client->>Route: GET /api/resource<br/>Authorization: Bearer <k8s-sa-token>
    Route->>Proxy: Forward (4180/TCP)
    Proxy->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>Proxy: TokenReview Response (authenticated: true)
    Proxy->>Upstream: Forward with validated identity
    Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client, Upstream: Flow 5: OpenShift OAuth Token (sha256~ prefix)
    Client->>Route: GET /api/resource<br/>Authorization: Bearer sha256~...
    Route->>Proxy: Forward (4180/TCP)
    Proxy->>K8sAPI: Validate OAuthAccessToken<br/>via OpenShift OAuth API
    K8sAPI-->>Proxy: Token valid
    Proxy->>Upstream: Forward with validated identity
    Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Client: Response
